        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted 55 Knights Wood to the Drogheda property market.\r\n\r\nAs you enter this impressive home, you are greeted by a spacious entrance hall that leads to a bright and inviting living room perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The modern kitchen and dining area, is located to the rear and offers direct access to the spacious rear garden, ideal for outdoor dining and family activities.  The downstairs layout is further enhanced by a guest WC. Upstairs, the property features three well-proportioned bedrooms (including primary with an en suite) along with a contemporary main bathroom. The property is further enhanced by a large attic conversion, offering a versatile space suitable for a variety of uses. The attic has also been thoughtfully plumbed to facilitate the installation of a further en suite, should the new owner wish to do so.\r\n\r\nLocated in the extremely popular development of Knightswood, Matthews Lane which is a commuters dream as it is situated close to the main M1 Motorway, giving ease of access to Dublin, Belfast and beyond. Situated close to shops, schools, creches and only minutes from Drogheda town centre, this property boasts aspects such as bright and spacious living accommodation, finished to a very high standard, this home is sure to attract strong interest from first timebuyers, second time buyers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is advised! \r\n\r\n*** *All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have.*"
